{"blocks":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"こんにちは！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"最近やっと春服買いに行く時間が\nできました〜\n春は可愛いのいっぱいあり過ぎて\n困りますね(´-ω-`)笑"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"買い物した後に気付いたのですが\n白ばっかり...(°_°)\n白可愛い...白に惹かれる..."},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"先日は初撮影会がありました！\nアルバム購入者特典イベント！\nかなりレアなイベントでした〜"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ポーズは全部で3種類"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"1 ピース\n2 ハート\n3 オリジナル"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"オリジナルポーズはもちろん♪\nみんな大体予想つくでしょ〜笑"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/reika.sakurai/img/blog/reika.sakurai/img/2015/03/10/5371245/0000.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ホイップ終わって、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/reika.sakurai/img/blog/reika.sakurai/img/2015/03/10/5371245/0001.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"あ、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/reika.sakurai/img/blog/reika.sakurai/img/2015/03/10/5371245/0002.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"嬉しそうに"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/reika.sakurai/img/blog/reika.sakurai/img/2015/03/10/5371245/0003.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"帰ってきた、帰ってきた笑"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/reika.sakurai/img/blog/reika.sakurai/img/2015/03/10/5371245/0004.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"撮影会は時間が全然なくて、\nほぼお話しできませんでしたね(´-ω-`)"},{"type":"break"},{"